:"This dataset contains classified bird stopover density information based on weather surveillance radar data from spring (2000-2003 and 2013-2015).","culture":"en-us"},"links":{"self":"https://hub.arcgis.com/api/v3/datasets/d3b5934d25a448bf8517e4f2ff094213","rawEs":"https://hub.arcgis.com/api/es/datasets/d3b5934d25a448bf8517e4f2ff094213","itemPage":"https://www.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=d3b5934d25a448bf8517e4f2ff094213","esriRest":"https://www.arcgis.com/sharing/content/items/d3b5934d25a448bf8517e4f2ff094213?f=json"},"meta":{"highlights":{"tags":["migration <mark class=\"hub-search-highlight tags-highlight\">radar</mark> nc spring"]},"matchedFields":["stemmedSearchDescription","tags","stemmedTags"]}},{"id":"a3c0473199e248dd98212a9f57b0fc5a","type":"dataset","attributes":{"errors":[],"access":"public","additionalResources":[],"collection":["Dataset"],"categories":[],"commentsEnabled":true,"composeStatus":{"lastSuccessAt":1772495654039,"retries":0,"pass":true,"lastRetriedAt":1772495654040},"composedAt":1772495654038,"content":"Feature Service","contentSecurityPolicy":null,"created":1755286596000,"currentVersion":12,"description":"<b>Overview</b>  \n<p>This feature service provides spatial data on US radar coverage by the National Weather Service (NWS) and Nielsen Designated Market Area (DMA) boundaries. It integrates multiple layers encompassing radar coverage quality, media market demographics, and population statistics.</p>  \n\n<b>Feature Layers</b>  \n<ul>  \n<li><b>National Nexrad Coverage</b>: Represents the radar coverage areas at various heights across the United States with spatial geometry delineating coverage zones. It serves as a national overview of radar reach and effectiveness at elevation levels.</li>  \n<li><b>Nexrad Poor Coverage (above 4k ft)</b>: Highlights areas with poor radar coverage at altitudes above 4,000 feet, identifying geographic regions where radar signal strength and quality may be insufficient for comprehensive weather monitoring.